    "id": "82c05f930601e3b2",
    "title": "Oraseya Capital Arrives at Expand North Star 2026 with a Bigger Cheque Book and a Wider Mandate",
    "summary": "Fresh from doubling its fund to AED 1 billion, the venture arm of Dubai Integrated Economic Zones (DIEZ) heads to Expand North Star looking for UAE founders, international companies choosing Dubai and, above all, co-investors.\nThe post Oraseya Capital Arrives at Expand North Star 2026 with a Bigger Cheque Book and a Wider Mandate appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://thefintechtimes.com/oraseya-capital-arrives-at-expand-north-star-2026-with-a-bigger-cheque-book-and-a-wider-mandate/",
    "source": "The Fintech Times",
    "tags": [
      "Oraseya Capital",
      "Dubai Integrated Economic Zones",
      "Dubai",
      "Expand North Star"
    ],
    "origin": "rss",
    "pubDate": "2026-11-27T06:00:27.000Z",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-11-27T06:01:26.795Z",
    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "Oraseya Capital, the venture capital arm of Dubai Integrated Economic Zones, is participating in Expand North Star with an increased fund of AED 1 billion and an expanded mandate. The firm is actively seeking to invest in UAE-based founders, international companies expanding to Dubai, and strategic co-investors to support regional startup growth.",
    "content_ta": "Dubai Integrated Economic Zones-ன் வென்ச்சர் கேப்பிடல் பிரிவான Oraseya Capital, AED 1 பில்லியன் நிதியுதவி மற்றும் விரிவாக்கப்பட்ட அதிகாரத்துடன் Expand North Star மாநாட்டில் பங்கேற்கிறது. ஐக்கிய அரபு அமீரகத்தைச் சேர்ந்த நிறுவனர்கள், துபாயை நோக்கிவரும் சர்வதேச நிறுவனங்கள் மற்றும் இணை முதலீட்டாளர்களை இந்நிறுவனம் தீவிரமாகத் தேடி வருகிறது.",
    "slug": "oraseya-capital-arrives-at-expand-north-star-2026-with-a-bigger-cheque-book-and-a-wider-mandate"
